    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d164">

                <pb facs="0288" n="122" sameAs="frus:frus1917/pg122"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 893.51/1744</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Minister Reinsch to the
                            Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Legation</hi></placeName>, <lb/>
                            [<date
                            ana="#date_undated-inferred-from-document-content-and-sibling-dates"
                            calendar="gregorian" notAfter="1917-02-09T11:30:00-05:00"
                            notBefore="1917-02-05T17:00:00-05:00"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Undated</hi></date>. <hi rendition="#italic">Received February 9,
                            1917, 11.30 a.m.</hi>]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Your telegram of February 5, 5 p.m. Upon renewed inquiry I find that the action
                    of Japanese Minister and banker was as reported in my January 15, 6 p.m.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Reinsch</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
